      "longBusinessSummary": "P.V. Nano Cell Ltd. engages in the development, manufacture, market, and commercialization of conductive inks for digital conductive printing applications. It offers Sicrys, a family of single crystal silver-based nano-metric conductive inks and pastes for printed electronics (PE) applications, including solar, automotive, digital printed electronics, and photovoltaics. The company is also involved in the development of single crystal copper-based nano-metric inks for mass-production of PE. In addition, it provides resistor inks; gold nano-particle water-based conductive ink for digital inkjet and aerosol printing; and inkjet printers under the DemonJet brand. The company operates in Spain, Israel, the United States, Japan, Germany, and internationally. P.V. Nano Cell Ltd. was incorporated in 2009 and is headquartered in Migdal Haemek, Israel.",
